me":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-23T17:52:06","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"5aac872c-f2da-4543-a914-ec72894bbdd6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":470017868,"PostDateInt":1784691008000,"PostDate":"2026-07-22T11:30:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"智算解决方案架构师(J23260)","OrgId":700391893,"Org":"政企BG.能力中心.AI基础设施部-北京","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责人工智能计算、高性能计算及云计算的整体架构设计。能够独立完成从底层基础设施、网络架构、算力集群到上层调度与应用平台的端到端解决方案编写。\n2.深入理解客户业务需求，如大模型训练、自动驾驶、生物制药、科学计算等，进行精准的AI场景评估。\n3.负责算力需求分析，根据模型参数量、数据量及训练/推理时效要求，科学评估算力规模（FLOPS）、显存、带宽及存储需求，提供最优性价比的硬件选型建议。\n4.熟悉主流AI硬件生态，重点掌握各类国产GPU加速卡（如华为昇腾、寒武纪、海光DCU、摩尔线程等）的性能指标、互联拓扑及软件栈兼容性。\n5.熟悉AI算力调度平台与AI开发平台方案，熟悉Kubernetes、Slurm、Docker等容器与调度技术。\n6.了解智能体开发，模型训练、微调及部署的全流程工具链方案。\n7.主导项目的招投标工作，包括撰写标书、技术建议书、进行POC测试及现场述标。\n8.对智算中心IDC机房基础设施（供配电、液冷/风冷散热、机柜布局等）有一定了解。\n9.了解数据采集、清洗、标注、存储（对象存储/并行文件系统）与AI计算的关联性","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，5年及以上IT基础设施、云计算、AI领域售前或技术支持相关工作经验；其中不少于2年AI算力、智算中心相关实战经验，具备完整智算中心或大型AI平台售前方案编写、落地实施经验者优先。\n2.精通服务器、存储、网络等基础架构；熟悉NVIDIA GPU体系，对昇腾、寒武纪等国产AI芯片有深入研究与实际方案落地经验。\n3.熟悉 PyTorch、TensorFlow、MindSpore 等主流 AI 框架的部署与运行环境，了解大模型（LLM）、Transformer 等基本原理与算力需求；\n4.了解数据中心建设标准，对高功率机柜、液冷等数据中心前沿技术与发展趋势具备基本认知。\n5.具备优秀的业务理解与价值转化能力，不局限于技术参数堆砌，可将技术方案转化为客户可感知的业务价值与ROI回报。\n6.具备出色的PPT方案制作、现场宣讲能力，可独立完成高质量技术方案、应标文件、招投标材料撰写。\n7.能适应售前岗位工作节奏，具备良好的抗压能力与跨部门协作能力，可高效协同销售、交付、研发等团队推进项目落地。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-22T11:30:08","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"16072066-e64e-49ed-b404-9fee9f4a2515","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":470017858,"PostDateInt":1784599181000,"PostDate":"2026-07-21T09:59:41","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"研发产品经理（可接受出差）(J23239)","OrgId":700529520,"Org":"AIBG.汽车BU.咨询业务部.技术交付部.产品-武汉","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.熟悉汽车研发领域业务流程，承接汽车研发领域业务需求分析、方案设计及系统落地等相关工作。\n2.牵引用户系统诉求，基于汽车研发领域发展要求，收集汽车研发域相关用户系统建设需求，层别切合用户真实需要之需求，结合流程单位梳出流程，形成合乎